    <description>A rebellion assembled out of the people the hierarchy was built to use. Reds out of the mines, Obsidians off the ice, Oranges who know exactly which part of a thing to break, and the occasional Gray who read the standing orders one time too many.\n\nThey are outgunned in every engagement they choose and they choose them carefully. What they have instead is that the Society cannot function without the Colors it despises, and every one of those Colors knows where the load-bearing walls are.\n\nThey will take help from anyone who does not ask what a person's Color is first.</description>
    <pawnSingular>Ares fighter</pawnSingular>
    <pawnsPlural>Ares fighters</pawnsPlural>
    <categoryTag>RR_Resistance</categoryTag>
    <listOrderPriority>50</listOrderPriority>
    <settlementGenerationWeight>0.8</settlementGenerationWeight>
    <requiredCountAtGameStart>1</requiredCountAtGameStart>
    <maxConfigurableAtWorldCreation>2</maxConfigurableAtWorldCreation>
    <canSiege>true</canSiege>
    <canStageAttacks>true</canStageAttacks>
    <leaderTitle>ares</leaderTitle>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
